				<r3d:description language="eng">Making Evidence Synthesis Data More Accessible and Reusable: https://effectivehealthcare.ahrq.gov/about/srdr-reflections

The Evidence-based Practice Center (EPC) at Tufts Medical Center, with support from the Agency for Healthcare Research and Quality (AHRQ), has developed the Systematic Review Data Repository (SRDR), which is a Web-based tool for data extraction and storage of systematic review data. Potential users include patients, policy makers/stakeholders, independent researchers, research centers, and funders of research.</r3d:description>
